libmarinholab-solver-qpoases (26.10.00) noble; urgency=medium

  * Fix CMake package config: the imported target is now created only
    when it does not exist, so calling find_package() more than once (a
    superbuild, or several components) no longer aborts with "another
    target with the same name already exists". Add the vendored qpOASES
    with EXCLUDE_FROM_ALL so the package no longer ships libqpOASES.a
    and cmake/qpOASES/, which resolved find_package(qpOASES) onto this
    private copy; its headers are installed by this project instead.

 -- Murilo M Marinho <murilomarinho@ieee.org>  Thu, 15 Oct 2026 01:19:40 +0000

libmarinholab-solver-qpoases (26.09.00) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian package of the C++ part of the solver-qpoases project:
    the marinholab::solvers::qpoases library (Solver + Configuration) and
    its qpOASES dependency, built with CMake and -O3.
    The pybind11 Python extension is not packaged; it is built by
    `pip install .`.

 -- Murilo M Marinho <murilomarinho@ieee.org>  Sun, 27 Sep 2026 01:10:33 +0100
